		<source xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/">Hub-curated EV-charging crosswalk for the EMDS demo (demo point C); not derived from an upstream NeTEx/DATEX II distribution — DATEX II and NeTEx are published natively as XSD and carry no canonical cross-standard SKOS mapping.</source>
		<creator xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/">EONA-X Vocabulary Hub</creator>
		<modified xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-06-26</modified>
		<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-06-22</created>
		<description xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/">Hub-curated EV-charging (IRVE) crosswalk for the EMDS demo: SKOS alignment between the DATEX II EnergyInfrastructure subset (#433) and the NeTEx/Transmodel-style subset (#445), so a term in one vocabulary resolves to its counterpart in the other.</description>
		<label xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">NeTEx ↔ DATEX II crosswalk (EV-charging)</label>
